{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37629","headline":"咸通十四年府试木向荣 · 郑谷","name":"咸通十四年府试木向荣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"园林青气动，衆木散寒声。\n败叶墙阴在，滋条雪後荣。\n欣欣春令早，蔼蔼日华轻。\n庾岭梅先觉，隋堤柳暗惊。\n山川应物候，臯壤起农情。\n秪待花开日，连栖出谷莺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37629.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37629","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}